# NIRMAN-RAKSHA Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Google Maps Platform (Optional)
# If provided, enables Google Maps Places autocomplete, satellite hybrid imagery, and street-level geocoding.
# If omitted or left blank, NIRMAN-RAKSHA automatically falls back to Leaflet + OpenStreetMap / CartoDB tiles with zero disruption.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# 2. Public Live Telemetry APIs (No Keys Required)
# - Open-Meteo Weather API: https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast (Free Public REST API)
# - Open-Meteo Air Quality API: https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality (Free Public REST API)
# - OpenStreetMap / CartoDB Voyager GIS Tiles (Free Open Access)
